@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:5173

### 先运行 auth.http 登录。创建无图标系列：201；再次执行同名请求：409。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/series
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=museum-boundary

--museum-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"QQ","description":"QQ 各平台历史版本及截图","category":"INSTANT_MESSAGING","platforms":["WINDOWS","ANDROID"]}
--museum-boundary--

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("seriesId", response.body.series.id);
%}

### 公开列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/series?page=0&size=20

### 上方创建成功后查询详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}

### 无图标时 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/series/{{seriesId}}/icon

### 创建带图标的系列：先将本目录 demo-icon.png 替换为自己的 PNG 或 JPEG。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/series
Origin: {{origin}}
X-App-Request: museum-web
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=museum-icon-boundary

--museum-icon-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"QQ 图标演示","description":"带小图标的系列","category":"INSTANT_MESSAGING","platforms":["WINDOWS"]}
--museum-icon-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="icon"; filename="demo-icon.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./demo-icon.png
--museum-icon-boundary--

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) client.global.set("seriesId", response.body.series.id);
%}
